10.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/releases\">langchain's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>langchain==1.3.10</h2>\n<p>Changes since langchain==1.3.9</p>\n<p>release(langchain): 1.3.10 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38255\">#38255</a>)\nchore: bump cryptography from 46.0.7 to 48.0.1 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38176\">#38176</a>)\nchore: bump aiohttp from 3.14.0 to 3.14.1 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38179\">#38179</a>)\nfix(langchain): switch summary format (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38171\">#38171</a>)\nfix(langchain): detect provider strategy for dated\n<code>gpt-5.2</code>/<code>gpt-5.4</code> snapshots (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38222\">#38222</a>)\nchore(langchain): improve typing in tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38163\">#38163</a>)\nchore: bump pyjwt from 2.12.0 to 2.13.0 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38168\">#38168</a>)\nrelease(openai): 1.3.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38130\">#38130</a>)\nhotfix(openai): switch version (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38123\">#38123</a>)\nrelease(openai): 1.4.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38120\">#38120</a>)\ndocs: refresh <code>README</code> installation and resources (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38119\">#38119</a>)\ntest(core,langchain): update tests for explicit deserialization\nallowlists (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38118\">#38118</a>)\nrelease(core): 1.4.7 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38111\">#38111</a>)\nrelease(anthropic): 1.4.6 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38105\">#38105</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/a807a9c7f61f50404ac65ffbe0521bad61f5551f\"><code>a807a9c</code></a>\nrelease(langchain): 1.3.10 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38255\">#38255</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/15b0a4930b5306bb2174f16d92fe4b7837147d0a\"><code>15b0a49</code></a>\nchore: bump jupyter-server from 2.18.0 to 2.20.0 in /libs/core (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38252\">#38252</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/612139f3af5f55b6311695fe6b139f0b6a6f68a2\"><code>612139f</code></a>\nchore: bump tornado from 6.5.6 to 6.5.7 in /libs/text-splitters (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38175\">#38175</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/921e370a67af4254b948de94c4db4587f4716a84\"><code>921e370</code></a>\nchore: bump cryptography from 46.0.7 to 48.0.1 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38176\">#38176</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/1aabc26836e0c1220121a1f37e3a2691e20f2f19\"><code>1aabc26</code></a>\nchore: bump aiohttp from 3.14.0 to 3.14.1 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38179\">#38179</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/8d51355f1f81825b72cb55303a39825ecbdc6b44\"><code>8d51355</code></a>\nchore: bump aiohttp from 3.14.0 to 3.14.1 in /libs/langchain (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38180\">#38180</a>)</li>\n<li><a