ect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38168\">#38168</a>)\nrelease(openai): 1.3.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38130\">#38130</a>)\nhotfix(openai): switch version (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38123\">#38123</a>)\nrelease(openai): 1.4.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38120\">#38120</a>)\ndocs: refresh <code>README</code> installation and resources (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38119\">#38119</a>)\ntest(core,langchain): update tests for explicit deserialization\nallowlists (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38118\">#38118</a>)\nrelease(core): 1.4.7 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38111\">#38111</a>)\nrelease(anthropic): 1.4.6 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38105\">#38105</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/a807a9c7f61f50404ac65ffbe0521bad61f5551f\"><code>a807a9c</code></a>\nrelease(langchain): 1.3.10 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38255\">#38255</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/15b0a4930b5306bb2174f16d92fe4b7837147d0a\"><code>15b0a49</code></a>\nchore: bump jupyter-server from 2.18.0 to 2.20.0 in /libs/core (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38252\">#38252</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/612139f3af5f55b6311695fe6b139f0b6a6f68a2\"><code>612139f</code></a>\nchore: bump tornado from 6.5.6 to 6.5.7 in /libs/text-splitters (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38175\">#38175</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/921e370a67af4254b948de94c4db4587f4716a84\"><code>921e37