s\">activity</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/dd65403362765017559797d819b2a14a2325bbad\"><code>dd65403</code></a>\n[ci skip] Publish 4.5.9</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/26936727d7f197bab4f314ca50690cd162d50312\"><code>2693672</code></a>\nBackport PR <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/18992\">#18992</a>:\nFix hidden cells after moving collapsed headings (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/19016\">#19016</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/360c1760b539e03438e95b7d9274ee7b53bc45bc\"><code>360c176</code></a>\nBackport PR <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/18998\">#18998</a>\non branch 4.5.x (Fix toolbar popup row clipping in Safari)...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/e9db01011d37365704ab21be870187ce848f2722\"><code>e9db010</code></a>\nFix <code>jupyter labextension build</code> crash on <code>webpack ≥\n5.107</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/19021\">#19021</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/3b8428c04e5ea4b3ed5dad5fcb68032d0bee84f2\"><code>3b8428c</code></a>\nBackport PR <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/19013\">#19013</a>\non branch 4.5.x (Forbid relative URLs in extensionmanager)...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/3c84a84cf4c5cfaf00686e772da3c60b58125cc6\"><code>3c84a84</code></a>\nBackport PR <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/19003\">#19003</a>\non branch 4.5.x (Fix XSS in extension manager's `homepage_...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/0dee9961fa67727b84093d79134bd4500ccdde71\"><code>0dee996</code></a>\n[ci skip] Publish 4.5.8<