h-sdk/pull/3050\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3050</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/compare/v0.8.16...v0.8.17\">https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/compare/v0.8.16...v0.8.17</a></p>\n<h2>v0.8.16</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>feat(py): add sync/async conversion for Sandbox and SandboxClient\n[INF-0000] by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ramon-langchain\"><code>@​ramon-langchain</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/pull/3019\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3019</a></li>\n<li>fix(experiments): extract keys from wrapped evaluator function by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/shamikkarkhanis\"><code>@​shamikkarkhanis</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/pull/3014\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3014</a></li>\n<li>chore: repoint <a\nhref=\"mailto:support@langchain.dev\">support@langchain.dev</a> mentions\nto the Support Portal by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/lutan-langchain\"><code>@​lutan-langchain</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/pull/3024\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3024</a></li>\n<li>fix(python): derive create_child run id from start_time [LSDK-220]\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/harisaiharish\"><code>@​harisaiharish</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/pull/3027\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3027</a></li>\n<li>chore: sync langsmith_api by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langtions-bot\"><code>@​langtions-bot</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/pull/3020\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3020</a></li>\n<li>chore: js to 0.7.8 and py to 0.8.16 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/shamikkarkhanis\"><code>@​shamikkarkhanis</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/pull/3029\">langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk#3029</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/31c2bf650b84a44577d8b4443298fb7e78025b8f\"><code>31c2bf6</code></a>\nrelease(py): 0.8.18 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/issues/3063\">#3063</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/8955b688689fdf47871d44013787410a42ea13fd\"><code>8955b68</code></a>\nchore: reconcile bumpversion config and mandate release process for\nagents (#...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/411401f6ca5ff401c29772ed097c9c9ed97f994c\"><code>411401f</code></a>\ntest(python): fix integration assertions for updated attachment error\nmessage...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/9c5515620f9bfa2145fc65d6f4353c4c8a3e96b6\"><code>9c55156</code></a>\nMerge commit from fork</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/5b2bd8db3c50d3f19e98f41288c87d9c0ac0b136\"><code>5b2bd8d</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump the npm_and_yarn group across 2 directories with 2\nupdates ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/d8642f9099a48025d00c7283ad3cd2ce56fec775\"><code>d8642f9</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump the npm_and_yarn group across 4 directories with 4\nupdates ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/953c2e5e25e41ecb4dba428adbac1c446c0a0071\"><code>953c2e5</code></a>\nchore(deps-dev): bump langchain-anthropic from 1.4.4 to 1.4.6 in /python\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/issues/3044\">#3044</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/5513699e2d25c2147e02c296bc3b90f7d0923d8a\"><code>5513699</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump starlette from 1.0.1 to 1.3.1 in /python (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/issues/3039\">#3039</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/8becdefdf422a02e03f78cf3ebb4c62c136b7cf3\"><code>8becdef</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump cryptography from 46.0.7 to 48.0.1 in /python (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/issues/3038\">#3038</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/commit/1a9c522febbf313bbe649ca75c39158fec048934\"><code>1a9c522</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump aiohttp from 3.14.0 to 3.14.1 in /python (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/issues/3037\">#3037</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langsmith-sdk/compare/v0.8.11...v0.8.18\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=langsmith&package-manager=uv&previous-version=0.8.11&new-version=0.8.18)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-22T17:11:06Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c07757e97b045092db06129a4f8654d1387744f2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c07757e97b045092db06129a4f8654d1387744f2","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c07757e97b045092db06129a4f8654d1387744f2/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f933fbf4a3fb37a88fd05a9ce9821e15a1272842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f933fbf4a3fb37a88fd05a9ce9821e15a1272842","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f933fbf4a3fb37a88fd05a9ce9821e15a1272842"}]},{"sha":"f933fbf4a3fb37a88fd05a9ce9821e15a1272842","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGY5MzNmYmY0YTNmYjM3YTg4ZmQwNWE5Y2U5ODIxZTE1YTEyNzI4NDI","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-22T16:54:00Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-22T16:54:00Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump bedrock-agentcore from 1.4.7 to 1.6.1 in /libs/code (#4110)\n\nBumps\n[bedrock-agentcore](https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python)\nfrom 1.4.7 to 1.6.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/releases\">bedrock-agentcore's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Bedrock AgentCore SDK v1.6.1</h2>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<pre lang=\"bash\"><code>pip install bedrock-agentcore==1.6.1\n</code></pre>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<p>See <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/blob/v1.6.1/CHANGELOG.md\">CHANGELOG.md</a>\nfor details.</p>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: pin griffe version and fix ExplanationStyle attribute error by\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sundargthb\"><code>@​sundargthb</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/381\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#381</a></li>\n<li>fix: skip integration tests for Dependabot and remove missing label\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/sundargthb\"><code>@​sundargthb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/382\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#382</a></li>\n<li>feat: add read_only flag to AgentCoreMemorySessionManager to disable\nACM persistence by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mohanasudhan\"><code>@​mohanasudhan</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/389\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#389</a></li>\n<li>fix(ci): add pytest-rerunfailures to integration test dependencies\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/jariy17\"><code>@​jariy17</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/400\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#400</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): bump boto3 and botocore minimum to 1.42.86 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jariy17\"><code>@​jariy17</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/399\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#399</a></li>\n<li>fix: replace blocklist with allowlist for install_packages() package\nvalidation by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/padmak30\"><code>@​padmak30</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/403\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#403</a></li>\n<li>Release v1.6.1 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/404\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#404</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mohanasudhan\"><code>@​mohanasudhan</code></a>\nmade their first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/389\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#389</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/compare/v1.6.0...v1.6.1\">https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/compare/v1.6.0...v1.6.1</a></p>\n<h2>Bedrock AgentCore SDK v1.6.0</h2>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<pre lang=\"bash\"><code>pip install bedrock-agentcore==1.6.0\n</code></pre>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<p>See <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/blob/v1.6.0/CHANGELOG.md\">CHANGELOG.md</a>\nfor details.</p>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: add custom code-based evaluator decorator and typed models by\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jariy17\"><code>@​jariy17</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/383\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#383</a></li>\n<li>Release v1.6.0 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/pull/385\">aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python#385</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/compare/v1.5.1...v1.6.0\">https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/compare/v1.5.1...v1.6.0</a></p>\n<h2>Bedrock AgentCore SDK v1.5.1</h2>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<pre lang=\"bash\"><code>pip install bedrock-agentcore==1.5.1\n</code></pre>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<p>See <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/blob/v1.5.1/CHANGELOG.md\">CHANGELOG.md</a>\nfor details.</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">bedrock-agentcore's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>[1.6.1] - 2026-04-10</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: add read_only flag to AgentCoreMemorySessionManager to disable\nACM persistence (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/389\">#389</a>)\n(215b5bd)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: replace blocklist with allowlist for install_packages() package\nvalidation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/403\">#403</a>)\n(ed953b5)</li>\n<li>fix: skip integration tests for Dependabot and remove missing label\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/382\">#382</a>)\n(4ebfdcb)</li>\n<li>fix: pin griffe version and fix ExplanationStyle attribute error (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/381\">#381</a>)\n(2bdb9f1)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>chore(deps): bump boto3 and botocore minimum to 1.42.86 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/399\">#399</a>)\n(df9a21d)</li>\n<li>fix(ci): add pytest-rerunfailures to integration test dependencies\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/400\">#400</a>)\n(5ccb283)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[1.6.0] - 2026-03-31</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: add custom code-based evaluator decorator and typed models (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/383\">#383</a>)\n(09f45f3)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[1.5.1] - 2026-03-31</h2>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Revert &quot;feat: Emit OTEL attributes for AgentCore Evaluation\nsupport (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/368\">#368</a>)&quot;\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/380\">#380</a>)\n(a516260)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[1.5.0] - 2026-03-30</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: add ground truth support to EvaluationClient and\nOnDemandEvaluationDatasetRunner (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/376\">#376</a>)\n(29b0115)</li>\n<li>feat: Add certificates to create_code_interpreter() (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/373\">#373</a>)\n(bc95735)</li>\n<li>feat: add support for policies and certificates (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/371\">#371</a>)\n(88c5101)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>chore: Modify arn parsing in runtime client to allow for different\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/362\">#362</a>)\n(a10c0fd)</li>\n<li>ci: add breaking change detection workflow for pull requests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/358\">#358</a>)\n(9341468)</li>\n<li>ci: add backward compatibility integration test workflow (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/357\">#357</a>)\n(50654c1)</li>\n<li>ci: add Dependabot auto-merge workflow (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/361\">#361</a>)\n(38425ec)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[1.4.8] - 2026-03-26</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: Emit OTEL attributes for AgentCore Evaluation support (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/368\">#368</a>)\n(8bae410)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: lazy import strands-agents-evals to avoid ImportError when not\ninstalled (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/367\">#367</a>)\n(2c4911d)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>ci: migrate PyPI publishing to OIDC Trusted Publishing (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/363\">#363</a>)\n(5bdf009)</li>\n<li>ci(deps): bump trufflesecurity/trufflehog from 3.93.8 to 3.94.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/360\">#360</a>)\n(cd86ebd)</li>\n<li>ci(deps): bump actions/github-script from 7 to 8 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/359\">#359</a>)\n(64db2f0)</li>\n<li>Skip LTM retrieval when content has no text (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/299\">#299</a>)\n(a49db7d)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/commit/5759f54a4f4babc06bbfee923c75615f0e5f3aea\"><code>5759f54</code></a>\nchore: bump version to 1.6.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/404\">#404</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/commit/ed953b58a96bd6d5ed1ca67792f6888cf04edf26\"><code>ed953b5</code></a>\nfix: replace blocklist with allowlist for install_packages() package\nvalidati...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/commit/df9a21d1cab0e232bf27ebe8f4a859bbeddd032a\"><code>df9a21d</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump boto3 and botocore minimum to 1.42.86 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/399\">#399</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/commit/5ccb2830e6f3ad000938849977f0ed3dd98e29e1\"><code>5ccb283</code></a>\nfix(ci): add pytest-rerunfailures to integration test dependencies (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aws/bedrock-agentcore-sdk-python/issues/400\">#400</a>