ttps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f"}]},{"sha":"c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGMyZDk0OWU4NzY1ZmJiYmRiODFlNWE3MDEyNTkzMjg0MjM1ODA5OWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-20T23:26:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-20T23:26:04Z"},"message":"fix(code): show \"Loading...\" in `/threads` agent dropdown while loading (#4101)\n\nThe `/threads` agent filter dropdown now shows \"Loading...\" while\nthreads are still loading.\n\n---\n\nThe agent dropdown in the `/threads` switcher is populated from visible\nthreads (plus the configured `/agents` list), so before the disk load\ncompletes it showed only the \"All agents\" sentinel. Now it shows a\n\"Loading...\" label while the load is pending and no agent names are\nknown yet, signaling that more options are on the way. Once the load\ncompletes, the dropdown rebuilds to the normal \"All agents\" + agent\noptions.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/e181c209-eed2-59bc-fbaa-7d77f84c4333)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9af83daec7f6fe7aec63c4f3dd508f36591acc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/9af83daec7f6fe7aec63c4f3dd508f36591acc30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNyGMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGdgQALBu2FmNdTGcgEKhbr1RjENu\no+9WoEO1DlzS4FTcjH84e+gMBshXXecnj7Wri1SNhwagAkHWgU0ClfzryO3EtwZr\nVg4LrwzRug8X5ONuCFOrwm7dvbl9n6wRUub0w1ozz8S85YI5bQisnSYzHqOgiKpz\nBIvjz5aPsf8ECuvBkj5tv2A4Xsm4i66Ns/4Bu9XmJ+d/dujz9/d1CXAi5mbvzl+j\nyXTQ3sUINu31qrHvuKeWYmKU+WORKVneccymZfmQHU/UtAbOHZJ4hPL3rppie7lf\n2feP9TV1KEORqPMpolBYk6C6IWC2jLpwrtkJ9Q2RSzA2pRHFTiZHGaUkWOL7Zc1m\njyKcBPlWlRxmXpV67lS7SsGMk2hpxX9D2dNX5hM8BOa9R4bH0JV/RJX3WXr5903p\nR4szeBP/6WBlNZM//Djrxbo4Dzw4zb/ep5BTzqccfEAoIehuNxhDGfWTW0iAcEjV\nZ6Z0C40bsciquSLVJKlZmtQGwaHj9VjW3yltDVCDcpALm8jF3/0EO6/qcwpsvL8J\nI6/U9R440Ma08psKi1tIGwqxZRaoXnnhI2p/9YC3LIV8CuTacaAos7VHzraBa0Il\nda5877Vw8fJtqjZTNMC2bLnboeiyepvVRzuXP9t5d6VR90hUh4vvSadVsTjcXcgn\nBEFhDSPnGIK4aGFkQzP7\n=bXI/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9af83daec7f6fe7aec63c4f3dd508f36591acc30\nparent 7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781997964 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781997964 -0400\n\nfix(code): show \"Loading...\" in `/threads` agent dropdown while loading (#4101)\n\nThe `/threads` agent filter dropdown now shows \"Loading...\" while\nthreads are still loading.\n\n---\n\nThe agent dropdown in the `/threads` switcher is populated from visible\nthreads (plus the configured `/agents` list), so before the disk load\ncompletes it showed only the \"All agents\" sentinel. Now it shows a\n\"Loading...\" label while the load is pending and no agent names are\nknown yet, signaling that more options are on the way. Once the load\ncompletes, the dropdown rebuilds to the normal \"All agents\" + agent\noptions.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/e181c209-eed2-59bc-fbaa-7d77f84c4333)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-20T23:26:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c2d949e8765fbbbdb81e5a70125932842358099f/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3"}]},{"sha":"7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDdhZTMyYjBhNjA2Y2MyMDBkNDMxMWUxMTAzNmE2NWYxN2U4MjgyYjM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-20T23:20:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-20T23:20:15Z"},"message":"fix(code): make `/timestamps` toggle instant via per-footer class (#4095)\n\nSpeed up the `/timestamps` toggle so it applies instantly, even on long\nconversations.\n\n---\n\nThe `/timestamps` command shows or hides a timestamp footer under each\nchat message. The original toggle was slow on long conversations because\nit mounted footers lazily: turning timestamps on walked every message,\nrecomputed `messages.children` and ran an `index()` lookup per message\n(O(n²) overall), then toggled a `message-timestamps-visible` class on\nthe `#messages` container.\n\nThat container class was itself a cost. The visibility selector was\nkeyed off `#messages`, so flipping it forced Textual to re-cascade\nstyles across the entire message subtree — O(mounted widgets) work on\nevery toggle.\n\nThis moves visibility onto the footers themselves:\n\n- **Footers are always mounted**, built alongside their message on every\npath (live messages, restored history, hydrated scrollback). Each is\nstamped with a `message-timestamp-footer-visible` class at build time\nwhen the preference is on, so restored and streamed footers render\nimmediately without waiting for a toggle.\n- **Toggling no longer mounts or removes anything.** `/timestamps` flips\nthe visible class on the already-mounted footer leaves inside a single\n`batch_update()`. Because the selector is now compound on the leaf\nrather than a descendant of `#messages`, only the footers restyle — not\nthe whole subtree.\n\nThe result is a single, bounded layout pass per toggle regardless of\nconversation length, with no per-message `index()` scan.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/ab4b0f22-d55a-9ff6-0d11-30183d52ac5a)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc754c2de83a3186ccddc7f86fd77a28aa6cb249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/fc754c2de83a3186ccddc7f86fd77a28aa6cb249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNyAvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6XwQAHSeQtQv4NqVrsnaVjHZU0Kn\nHGBRFV7+VtSqnyHdgU4mksxWRwDZxj33toslicHhOWWpp9wK15N9KoCUiJpIdiLX\nVPPPRkXmpyJ7aZPhKL/I4fiiUY/zxwSc5nps2UzxLJdNhhYZnHJbZqE2/HsJjVAa\n7pYRW4ajw1AkHjnjg9D+p7Kt7FfijbqwP396ILdRCw4DVcw3f83u06TdW1HpHXD5\nFBuf8xjcftSdjNdLlpFnRgTI6X2E28ZCnTxPywORwFzgdFzVsVKyYzJ+rjW0+yAf\n16tP0gMup+YmGk4jiugzQaGb2ucGcCvFVKLScXCL/UYJn8JW8056r04p/p2BOVSF\nP5V8XSJ6Q1Y2YL6xY4ZfXu8QziwFkava/qQfBasaGXKZJdVKoDdEZPsmy3DuiR4h\nBiz8w8IfDuDPl7J4GOnQSQwTqudUkUcbLaHrraETnuJiCRJMQ7rcZ4EdTCPV10PC\nqy7RCKAr5hfN0Apj36DVGCyTDbmU2nMK7ZDvzWw+G2DZpHGIsJ3XMF25lIOknXjW\nLGPERwVQUnSHsRhibD8omwF8G8qp5cfI0RljFS1pk2JtMp/FNyBvZLoojyoreTfS\nzv9G18AK90FcVp3VBXELa6nivi0rGyF8m5M61cr00s+l9i1HIJ8QN+Dxt0gp89Xx\nxWARrEZGxaLPqeGIZH+x\n=QxVU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree fc754c2de83a3186ccddc7f86fd77a28aa6cb249\nparent 5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781997615 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781997615 -0400\n\nfix(code): make `/timestamps` toggle instant via per-footer class (#4095)\n\nSpeed up the `/timestamps` toggle so it applies instantly, even on long\nconversations.\n\n---\n\nThe `/timestamps` command shows or hides a timestamp footer under each\nchat message. The original toggle was slow on long conversations because\nit mounted footers lazily: turning timestamps on walked every message,\nrecomputed `messages.children` and ran an `index()` lookup per message\n(O(n²) overall), then toggled a `message-timestamps-visible` class on\nthe `#messages` container.\n\nThat container class was itself a cost. The visibility selector was\nkeyed off `#messages`, so flipping it forced Textual to re-cascade\nstyles across the entire message subtree — O(mounted widgets) work on\nevery toggle.\n\nThis moves visibility onto the footers themselves:\n\n- **Footers are always mounted**, built alongside their message on every\npath (live messages, restored history, hydrated scrollback). Each is\nstamped with a `message-timestamp-footer-visible` class at build time\nwhen the preference is on, so restored and streamed footers render\nimmediately without waiting for a toggle.\n- **Toggling no longer mounts or removes anything.** `/timestamps` flips\nthe visible class on the already-mounted footer leaves inside a single\n`batch_update()`. Because the selector is now compound on the leaf\nrather than a descendant of `#messages`, only the footers restyle — not\nthe whole subtree.\n\nThe result is a single, bounded layout pass per toggle regardless of\nconversation length, with no per-message `index()` scan.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/ab4b0f22-d55a-9ff6-0d11-30183d52ac5a)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-20T23:20:15Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7ae32b0a606cc200d4311e11036a65f17e8282b3/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6"}]},{"sha":"5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDVlMzM3YWU1MGE3NmJjMTc0Yjc1MmJlMTg3ZTYyNjk4YTM4OWNiZTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"John Kennedy","email":"65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-20T19:02:25Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-20T19:02:25Z"},"message":"fix(talon): default workspace to current directory (#4099)\n\nTalon currently defaults its local execution backend to `/workspace`,\nwhich only exists in the Docker example. Bare-metal runs can fail before\nthe agent command executes because `LocalShellBackend` receives a\nmissing working directory.\n\nThis changes the unset workspace behavior to use the process current\nworking directory, while still preserving explicit\n`DEEPAGENTS_TALON_WORKSPACE` and `DEEPAGENTS_TALON_OUTBOUND_MEDIA_DIR`\noverrides. The Docker example continues to set\n`DEEPAGENTS_TALON_WORKSPACE=/workspace`, so container behavior is\nunchanged.\n\nTests run:\n- `uv run --group test pytest tests/test_runtime.py\ntests/channels/test_whatsapp.py`\n- `make lint`\n- `make test`\n\nCo-authored-by: Deep Agent <agent@deepagents.dev>","tree":{"sha":"c1075cb7afd609eacc48a0799678abd9b4618a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c1075cb7afd609eacc48a0799678abd9b4618a6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNuPBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIA0QAIp4DbCA/LZ49F5SuulfhQpJ\n6pfVGn/i1vAeN9jU6R7eT4WJb3aOSsxWML4yC0k59bmS8FEIUrMLABGueWYOJVnh\nVofN++XDNOmN79K3lwYwaCy2cmqyWzjulz2SfkQw2GqGLdBKARjiHCuCq19A/7ag\nxUzKXBdGGCxWgfmA0JX0Ete3/dr/IHS+xWrj3vR/SZUpD4GyNdfB0xHEhTxQdDbw\npTSelCUZd9GJ4NBYXQfBAhjTOqZb4s1NGn3C0QGQvgQSFf2FjEdHT+veSSFzqNTt\nsA+6sJ1U9DIp6bUNQU38iudxwduxk3OHptaA2Juv76OyeUPOt7ymC0BMK7L2C9Ca\nfoZZqNF3vmv0sisMhynR2QPDe0Vej0g+cf9sCsvVcZnsxkV0zmQRi72MAiOBQoAm\nNgPbWssLOgjqnr/Vq5/3p1tySOSkLv+ebeZDbT079hB6Rv69meUoo2YmYUCnYFyd\nwsbkd9v2quA2SA1sCLIgQfB6hBY7O3oNIhuzudNpIXQyYLIA0PtsddldB7rzXt/t\nl/wZHr0YJ/Oq36FbXjHh8EjmFpPJJJozwNaeQwBm28HlM7JA31qQH2wXZjViP9VO\nzLZhFKSQ13JO75j0HAlYd47VwApT104qx8+SpHVTrMav530NGpbys2xq+GihCMhA\nBuvS758RmPNpPsW1XYJZ\n=sidd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c1075cb7afd609eacc48a0799678abd9b4618a6d\nparent e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db\nauthor John Kennedy <65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com> 1781982145 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781982145 -0700\n\nfix(talon): default workspace to current directory (#4099)\n\nTalon currently defaults its local execution backend to `/workspace`,\nwhich only exists in the Docker example. Bare-metal runs can fail before\nthe agent command executes because `LocalShellBackend` receives a\nmissing working directory.\n\nThis changes the unset workspace behavior to use the process current\nworking directory, while still preserving explicit\n`DEEPAGENTS_TALON_WORKSPACE` and `DEEPAGENTS_TALON_OUTBOUND_MEDIA_DIR`\noverrides. The Docker example continues to set\n`DEEPAGENTS_TALON_WORKSPACE=/workspace`, so container behavior is\nunchanged.\n\nTests run:\n- `uv run --group test pytest tests/test_runtime.py\ntests/channels/test_whatsapp.py`\n- `make lint`\n- `make test`\n\nCo-authored-by: Deep Agent <agent@deepagents.dev>","verified_at":"2026-06-20T19:02:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5e337ae50a76bc174b752be187e62698a389cbe6/comments","author":{"login":"jkennedyvz","id":65985482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTg1NDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65985482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz","html_url":"https://github.com/jkennedyvz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db"}]},{"sha":"e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGU1MDk0MDM3ZjkyMzhkMzdjZjc0NTg2MjJhOGM3OTA4MDE1NTM2ZGI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-20T07:04:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-20T07:04:04Z"},"message":"docs(repo): add architecture and development onboarding guides (#3983)\n\nNew-contributor onboarding currently requires stitching knowledge\ntogether from `AGENTS.md`, per-package `Makefile`s, and external docs,\nand neither the cross-layer request flow nor the `libs/code` process\nmodel is mapped anywhere in the repo.\n\nThis adds:\n- Root `ARCHITECTURE.md` (the three-layer `deepagents` → `create_agent`\n→ LangGraph stack and request flow) and `DEVELOPMENT.md` (a single\nbootstrap + command reference), cross-linked from `README.md` and\n`libs/README.md`.\n- `libs/code/ARCHITECTURE.md` (process model, interactive/headless\nrequest lifecycles, module map, and a \"where do I change X\" cheat\nsheet), linked from `DEV.md` and `AGENTS.md`.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7d12f5240d1a176622d04425a286d6aafeab9bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/a7d12f5240d1a176622d04425a286d6aafeab9bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNjtkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATU8QADFCTpnC4RA4gaL/m6GN9z8M\nYOH/iMkH+ZA66LFYyTwhDLfs+JlHlBr2yynO+6EzvF7KWJ21dRu6epCF6wDDQDFy\nI9S51OgAIMMVOCdAsYcuxgnlY1hKRdxr9iMDeXpHnmlCyzedBJ0qvnN2DFG2PZ3X\nLC/0SouQ+gE3EHIjdnWvVrd4DJLMzZw6SW9rbhHdfBuzITOCyQnf0m7vDgUX4Igx\nBVYu5WHt9EcU1+heJLBIBVJsoSZ7yHtgtiLhDBgSwkX/L5zHKjo3YvwSYa1SUD37\nMxDkAILBfJQwtTtUT96+qs43dcBiIj5WHwAsaqyB6XxNgWd84iTsFRBBpw0qTf+b\ndbrPAmY4MTrLoCnAFL9Cc6eneL2x8aNFwwvDKmOUBHd5S8ZlD3ZEUDA+RyLq+PU1\nkrqu91TtzGWBYGhUc/NDmVHY8zEIDiCqsguo9BrLLJzCPYC56RHf7JOFFyNtGnWa\n34lA6D1LMmQZKDDFJtpDmXiKel+pZp+MMVTmQzpgDd3tR/BL3kiA7K33+GW07dZn\nSArLAVf8xBzj1EpRDsV/H7QlzJg860rtFmKun8qkmlq180jn3B5xla/JyPbT7BHN\noWOs4jIiEa66S6ajfgUDmUhkV3nDTdj+F9qoSttbV6x3HEInxNqconeW6h35hO26\ngt2slIs73+lpE3IZ5iGB\n=oNXz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree a7d12f5240d1a176622d04425a286d6aafeab9bf\nparent d3cecf9bd2c226ae4891157dbb2ce45b53e29c53\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1781939044 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781939044 -0400\n\ndocs(repo): add architecture and development onboarding guides (#3983)\n\nNew-contributor onboarding currently requires stitching knowledge\ntogether from `AGENTS.md`, per-package `Makefile`s, and external docs,\nand neither the cross-layer request flow nor the `libs/code` process\nmodel is mapped anywhere in the repo.\n\nThis adds:\n- Root `ARCHITECTURE.md` (the three-layer `deepagents` → `create_agent`\n→ LangGraph stack and request flow) and `DEVELOPMENT.md` (a single\nbootstrap + command reference), cross-linked from `README.md` and\n`libs/README.md`.\n- `libs/code/ARCHITECTURE.md` (process model, interactive/headless\nrequest lifecycles, module map, and a \"where do I change X\" cheat\nsheet), linked from `DEV.md` and `AGENTS.md`.\n\nMade by [Open SWE](https://openswe.vercel.app)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-20T07:04:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e5094037f9238d37cf7458622a8c7908015536db/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_use