.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38255\">#38255</a>)\nchore: bump cryptography from 46.0.7 to 48.0.1 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38176\">#38176</a>)\nchore: bump aiohttp from 3.14.0 to 3.14.1 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38179\">#38179</a>)\nfix(langchain): switch summary format (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38171\">#38171</a>)\nfix(langchain): detect provider strategy for dated\n<code>gpt-5.2</code>/<code>gpt-5.4</code> snapshots (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38222\">#38222</a>)\nchore(langchain): improve typing in tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38163\">#38163</a>)\nchore: bump pyjwt from 2.12.0 to 2.13.0 in /libs/langchain_v1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38168\">#38168</a>)\nrelease(openai): 1.3.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38130\">#38130</a>)\nhotfix(openai): switch version (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38123\">#38123</a>)\nrelease(openai): 1.4.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38120\">#38120</a>)\ndocs: refresh <code>README</code> installation and resources (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38119\">#38119</a>)\ntest(core,langchain): update tests for explicit deserialization\nallowlists (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38118\">#38118</a>)\nrelease(core): 1.4.7 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38111\">#38111</a>)\nrelease(anthropic): 1.4.6 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38105\">#38105</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/lang